# .env.example
# =============
# This project runs entirely locally and does NOT require any API keys,
# credentials, or secret tokens.
#
# No values need to be filled in for this project to work.
# This file is provided as a template placeholder for future extensions.
#
# If you ever add external services (e.g., a cloud API), add keys here:
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=your_key_here
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit real keys or passwords to a public repository.
# Always add your actual .env file to .gitignore.
